 this far.",author:"Mike, Student from Buckhurst Hill",color:"bg-teal-100 text-teal-600"},{title:"Rigour & Advanced Application",quote:"James has been helping our foster child with his understanding of Animal Farm. I know K enjoys his lessons with James and finds them stimulating and we really appreciate the thorough and planned approach.",author:"Samantha, Parent from Bristol",color:"bg-rose-100 text-rose-600"},{title:"The Structural Approach",quote:"James tutored our son for a year in preparation for GCSE English Literature and Language. James is an excellent tutor, breaking down topics into easy to understand segments and offering practical learning and revision aids.",author:"Clare, Parent from Letchworth Garden City",color:"bg-purple-100 text-purple-600"},{title:"Concrete Grade Jump",quote:"James is a very inspiring teacher, he helped me so much in my IGCSE English studies and has improved my grades massively. I felt very grateful for having such a teacher who guides me.",author:"Jing, Parent from Madrid",color:"bg-orange-100 text-orange-600"},{title:"Exam Technique & Structure",quote:"James is a great tutor, he has helped me advance in English and now I am much more confident than I was when I started. He patiently works with you and in each lesson, he introduces new ideas and techniques to include in your writing.",author:"Paul, Parent from Dalston",color:"bg-fuchsia-100 text-fuchsia-600"},{title:"Rigour & Advanced Application",quote:"James helped me with my university application and it turned out absolutely amazing. Thanks a lot James !",author:"Darius, Student",color:"bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600"},{title:"Concrete Grade Jump",quote:"His teaching made a real difference for me and played a key role in helping me achieve the grade I was aiming for. Thank you.",author:"Sawsan, Parent from Kuwait",color:"bg-cyan-100 text-cyan-600"},{title:"Exam Technique & Structure",quote:"James has been a great tutor for me with english language, really helped to build my confidence in the subject and in exam technique too so now i can answer every question comfortably and to a good standard.",author:"Teddy, Parent from York",color:"bg-blue-100 text-blue-600"}];return w.jsx("section",{id:"reviews",className:"pt-24 pb-12 bg-transparent overflow-hidden",children:w.jsxs("div",{className:"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8",children:[w.jsxs("div",{className:"text-center mb-16",children:[w.jsx("h2",{className:"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4",children:"Proven Exam Results"}),w.jsx("p",{className:"text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto",children:"Concrete grade jumps, improved confidence, and reliable structure."})]}),w.jsx(Hl,{className:"px-8 md:px-16",children:w.jsxs(zx,{opts:{align:"start",loop:!0},plugins:[cf({delay:7500,stopOnInteraction:!0})],className:"w-full",children:[w.jsx(Mx,{className:"-ml-4 md:-ml-6 py-12",children:a.map((i,o)=>w.jsx(Dx,{className:"pl-4 md:pl-6 md:basis-1/2 lg:basis-1/3",children:w.jsx("div",{className:"p-1",children:w.jsxs(Q1,{className:"overflow-visible border-none shadow-lg bg-white rounded-3xl relative mt-8",children:[w.jsx("div",{className:`absolute -top-8 left-8 w-16 h-16 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center border-4 border-white shadow-sm ${i.color}`,children:w.jsx(oS,{className:"w-8 h-8"})}),w.jsxs(Z1,{className:"pt-12 pb-6 px-8 flex flex-col",children:[w.jsx("h3",{className:"text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-cyan-600 mb-4",children:i.title}),w.jsxs("p",{className:"text-slate-700 italic mb-4 leading-relaxed relative",children:[w.jsx("span",{className:"text-4xl text-slate-200 absolute -top-4 -left-2 font-serif",children:'"'}),w.jsx("span",{className:"relative z-10",children:i.quote}),w.jsx("span",{className:"text-4xl text-slate-200 absolute -bottom-6 -right-2 font-serif",children:'"'})]}),w.jsx("div",{className:"pt-4 border-t border-slate-100",children:w.jsx("p",{className:"text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900",children:i.author})})]})]})})},o))}),w.jsx(_